{"3797260": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Animal Style", "steam_appid": 3797260, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're living the dream. You're a cat running your own hotdog shop! Sauce 80+ unique food puzzles and become a master sauce-slinger in <strong>Animal Style!</strong> Manage your shop and fulfill orders for your hungry (or sometimes <i>hangry</i>) animal customers as you learn the art of Sauce Balancing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797260/extras/109576417ece3b87217cac2ba6159ff8.poster.avif?t=1777392054\" width=1170 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797260/extras/109576417ece3b87217cac2ba6159ff8.webm?t=1777392054\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797260/extras/109576417ece3b87217cac2ba6159ff8.mp4?t=1777392054\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Befriend the regulars, and sauce 'em up!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The residents of Pawston come in all different species, shapes and sizes! Some are serious, some are goofy, and some are downright unhinged. Listen to their tales, contemplate life, and serve them the sauce they need to get through the day.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Save the city from a dry, sauce-less future...</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797260/extras/998eca4709acdc4adf90a8b8449dc6d3.poster.avif?t=1777392054\" width=1170 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797260/extras/998eca4709acdc4adf90a8b8449dc6d3.webm?t=1777392054\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797260/extras/998eca4709acdc4adf90a8b8449dc6d3.mp4?t=1777392054\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The evil hivemind is invading  Pawston! Can you harness all the sauces to defeat the invaders and save everyone from a dry, sauce-less future? Use the patent-pending Sauce Cannon to repel evil. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn money to upgrade your sauce bottles and kegs. Progress though the perk board to unlock all the sauces, as well as some fun extras! Decorate the shop. Print memes. Use the arcade machine to re-sauce any object you have encountered. </p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're living the dream. You're a cat running your own hotdog shop! Sauce 80+ unique food puzzles and become a master sauce-slinger in <strong>Animal Style!</strong> Manage your shop and fulfill orders for your hungry (or sometimes <i>hangry</i>) animal customers as you learn the art of Sauce Balancing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797260/extras/109576417ece3b87217cac2ba6159ff8.poster.avif?t=1777392054\" width=1170 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797260/extras/109576417ece3b87217cac2ba6159ff8.webm?t=1777392054\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797260/extras/109576417ece3b87217cac2ba6159ff8.mp4?t=1777392054\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Befriend the regulars, and sauce 'em up!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The residents of Pawston come in all different species, shapes and sizes! Some are serious, some are goofy, and some are downright unhinged. Listen to their tales, contemplate life, and serve them the sauce they need to get through the day.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Save the city from a dry, sauce-less future...</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797260/extras/998eca4709acdc4adf90a8b8449dc6d3.poster.avif?t=1777392054\" width=1170 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797260/extras/998eca4709acdc4adf90a8b8449dc6d3.webm?t=1777392054\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797260/extras/998eca4709acdc4adf90a8b8449dc6d3.mp4?t=1777392054\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The evil hivemind is invading  Pawston! Can you harness all the sauces to defeat the invaders and save everyone from a dry, sauce-less future? Use the patent-pending Sauce Cannon to repel evil. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn money to upgrade your sauce bottles and kegs. Progress though the perk board to unlock all the sauces, as well as some fun extras! Decorate the shop. Print memes. Use the arcade machine to re-sauce any object you have encountered. </p>", "short_description": "You're a cat running your own hotdog shop! Use realistic fluid physics to sauce a huge variety of foods. Each food is a puzzle! Manage your shop, unlock upgrades, save the furry residents of Pawston, and make sure not to lose your balance....", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797260/ba5bd36c3a79cf593e1f0eb36fcde20f6c42e20c/header.jpg?t=1777392054", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797260/bfcdc057932e104c7ab6b859129fc24d7a8efb81/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1777392054", "capsule_imagev5": "https:/